---
// ChainOfCustody.astro
// EL GRAN DIFERENCIADOR: ningún competidor chileno muestra qué pasa con el dispositivo
// después del retiro. Esta sección llena ese vacío con transparencia radical.
---

<section id="cadena" class="relative w-full py-32 overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900 via-slate-800 to-slate-900">
  <!-- Background accent elements -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10">
    <div class="absolute top-32 left-0 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-500/20 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-20">
      <div class="inline-block mb-4">
        <span class="inline-block text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase px-4 py-2 rounded-full" style="background: rgba(251, 146, 60, 0.1); color: #FB923C;">
          Transparencia total
        </span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
        Tu equipo llega aquí.<br/><span class="text-amber-500">Esto pasa después.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-400 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Mientras otros te entregan un certificado al final, nosotros te mostramos cada paso del recorrido. Control total de principio a fin.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Chain of Custody — 6 steps timeline -->
    <div class="space-y-8 mb-16">

      <!-- Step 1 — Retiro en tu empresa -->
      <div class="group relative">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/30 to-orange-500/20 flex items-center justify-center border border-amber-500/50 shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/20 group-hover:shadow-xl group-hover:shadow-amber-500/30 transition-all duration-300">
              <span class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-400">01</span>
            </div>
            <div class="h-24 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-amber-500/30 to-slate-700/30 mt-2"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 pt-2">
            <div class="relative bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-700/50 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-amber-500/30 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-amber-500/10">
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Retiro en tus instalaciones</h3>
              <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Coordinamos el retiro con partners logísticos certificados, manifiestos de transporte y acta de recepción firmada. Confirmación dentro de 48 horas.
              </p>
              <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-green-400">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-400"></span>
                <span>Acta de recepción emitida</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 — Recepción y pesaje -->
      <div class="group relative">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/30 to-orange-500/20 flex items-center justify-center border border-amber-500/50 shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/20 group-hover:shadow-xl group-hover:shadow-amber-500/30 transition-all duration-300">
              <span class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-400">02</span>
            </div>
            <div class="h-24 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-amber-500/30 to-slate-700/30 mt-2"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 pt-2">
            <div class="relative bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-700/50 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-amber-500/30 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-amber-500/10">
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Recepción y pesaje certificado</h3>
              <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Cada RAEE es pesado, fotografiado e ingresado a nuestro sistema de trazabilidad con número de serie único. Reporte digital en 3-5 días hábiles.
              </p>
              <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-green-400">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-400"></span>
                <span>Reporte digital de ingreso</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 — Destrucción de datos (FEATURED) -->
      <div class="group relative">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/20 to-orange-500/10 rounded-2xl blur-xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500"></div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/40 to-orange-500/20 flex items-center justify-center border-2 border-amber-500/50 shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/30 group-hover:shadow-xl group-hover:shadow-amber-500/40 transition-all duration-300">
              <span class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-300">03</span>
            </div>
            <div class="h-24 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-amber-500/40 to-slate-700/30 mt-2"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 pt-2">
            <div class="relative bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-xl border border-amber-500/30 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-amber-500/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-amber-500/20">
              <div class="inline-block mb-4">
                <span class="text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300">
                  🔒 CRÍTICO
                </span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Destrucción certificada de datos</h3>
              <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Borrado seguro o destrucción física del soporte de almacenamiento. Certificado individual por dispositivo con número de serie, método y fecha, válido para auditorías de cumplimiento normativo.
              </p>
              <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-green-400">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-400"></span>
                <span>Certificado por dispositivo</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 4 — Desmantelamiento y clasificación -->
      <div class="group relative">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/30 to-orange-500/20 flex items-center justify-center border border-amber-500/50 shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/20 group-hover:shadow-xl group-hover:shadow-amber-500/30 transition-all duration-300">
              <span class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-400">04</span>
            </div>
            <div class="h-24 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-amber-500/30 to-slate-700/30 mt-2"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 pt-2">
            <div class="relative bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-700/50 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-amber-500/30 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-amber-500/10">
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Desmantelamiento y clasificación</h3>
              <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Separación manual y mecánica de componentes: metales ferrosos, cobre, aluminio, tarjetas electrónicas, plásticos y materiales peligrosos.
              </p>
              <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-green-400">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-400"></span>
                <span>Clasificación por tipo de material</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 5 — Valorización de materiales -->
      <div class="group relative">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/30 to-orange-500/20 flex items-center justify-center border border-amber-500/50 shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/20 group-hover:shadow-xl group-hover:shadow-amber-500/30 transition-all duration-300">
              <span class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-400">05</span>
            </div>
            <div class="h-24 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-amber-500/30 to-slate-700/30 mt-2"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 pt-2">
            <div class="relative bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-700/50 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-amber-500/30 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-amber-500/10">
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Valorización de materiales</h3>
              <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Recuperación de cobre, oro, plata, paladio, aluminio y plásticos de ingeniería. Los materiales regresan al ciclo productivo como materia prima secundaria.
              </p>
              <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-green-400">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-400"></span>
                <span>Materiales regresan al ciclo productivo</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 6 — Certificado de disposición final -->
      <div class="group relative">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/30 to-orange-500/20 flex items-center justify-center border border-amber-500/50 shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/20 group-hover:shadow-xl group-hover:shadow-amber-500/30 transition-all duration-300">
              <span class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-400">06</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 pt-2">
            <div class="relative bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-700/50 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-amber-500/30 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-amber-500/10">
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Certificado en tu correo</h3>
              <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Certificado digital de disposición final, reporte de materiales recuperados y métricas de impacto ambiental (CO₂ evitado, kg valorizados). Válido para ESG y auditoría REP.
              </p>
              <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-green-400">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-400"></span>
                <span>Certificado digital + reporte</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom CTA row -->
    <div class="relative mt-20">
      <!-- Background gradient overlay -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/10 to-orange-500/5 rounded-2xl blur-xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500"></div>

      <!-- Glassmorphic card -->
      <div class="relative bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-700/50 rounded-2xl p-8 sm:p-12 hover:border-amber-500/30 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-amber-500/10">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-6">
          <div>
            <p class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2" data-i18n="chain.cta.title">
              ¿Listo para iniciar gestión de tus RAEE?
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400" data-i18n="chain.cta.subtitle">
              Pre-regístrate como cliente ancla. Iniciamos operaciones agosto 2026.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="#contacto"
            class="flex-shrink-0 inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold text-white bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-600 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-amber-500/30 hover:-translate-y-0.5 whitespace-nowrap"
            data-i18n="chain.cta.button"
          >
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"/>
            </svg>
            Pre-registrarme como cliente ancla
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
